**Analysis of `PolicyAccountingPage.tsx`:**

I've examined the code and found the section that renders the list of accounting integrations. The key part is within the `connectionsMenuItems` memoized value, specifically the `.map` function that iterates through `accountingIntegrations`.

```javascript
<Button
    onPress={() => startIntegrationFlow({name: integration})}
    text={translate('workspace.accounting.setup')}
    style={integration === CONST.POLICY.CONNECTIONS.NAME.QBO ? {} : styles.justifyContentCenter}
